{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36182","headline":"送弟子伍秀才赴举 · 方干","name":"送弟子伍秀才赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天遣相门延积庆，今同太庙荐嘉宾。\n柳条此日同谁折，桂树明年爲尔春。\n倚棹寒吟渔浦月，垂鞭醉入凤城尘。\n由来不要文章得，要且文章出衆人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36182.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36182","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}